{"from": "claim:mk-12-32-34-scribe-wise-answer", "type": "related_to", "to": "text:hosea-6", "note": "The scribe's judgment that love is more than all whole burnt offerings and sacrifices echoes Hosea 6:6 ('I desire mercy, and not sacrifice'); a biblical cross-reference, not evidence."}
